    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'09PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.07.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER PROVISO (a) TO SECTION 38\n\nOrder No. 128 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No. : 4-3/ 9/ 2016/ IR/ 170-C.Sec. Ref No.: je/b/01/M,a Ma.\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of theland specified in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of thatSchedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.03rd July, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Land Acquiring Officer.- Divisional Secretary, Wellawaya.\n\n2. Description of the land .- Allotments of Land depicted in theAdvance Tracing No. MO/WLL/UMA/2017/653, dated 14.06.2018prepared by the Surveyor-General situated in the Village called MahaAaragama (F.T.P.71), in the Grama Niladari Division ofMahaAaragama, in the Wellawaya Korale Minor Division, in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wellawaya in Monaragala Districtof Uva Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Thelullakele \u2013 Extent : About 3.4163 HectaresNorth: Maha Aara and Lot. B; East: Maha Aara, Lots. B, BL andBM; South: Lots. BL, BM, BN and Kirindi Oya; West: Lot. BN,Kirindi Oya and Maha Aara.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Thelullakele \u2013 Extent : About 2.4128 HectaresNorth: Lot. A, Maha Aara and Lots C and D; East: Lots. C, D andBH; South: Lots. D, BH, BL and A; West: Lots. BL, A and MahaAara.\n\n03. Lot \u2018C\u2019 \u2013 Thelullakele \u2013 Extent : About 0.3704 HectareNorth: Maha Aara and Road; East: Road and Lot. D; South: Lots.D, B and Maha Aara; West: Lot. B and Maha Aara."
