    "chunk_text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) - PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nNORTH WESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\n2 A IV(A) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.07.12 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.07.2019\n\nShort title and effective date of regulations\n\n1 These regulations may be cited as the Code of Co-operative Electoral (Amendment) Regulations for electing Regional Committee Members of Multipurpose Co-operative Societies in North-Western Province and shall come into force for North-Western Province from the date of its publication in the Gazette.\n\nAmendment of sections 5.1 (c) and 5.2(c) of the Code of Regulations\n\n2.1 section 5.1 (c) of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended by the addition therefor of the following paragraph.\n\n(c) Provision of Electoral Registers to the Commissioner of Co-operative Development and Registrar of Co-operative Societies, North-Western Province by a Compact Disc (CD) or a Digital Video Disk (DVD) or a Flash (Pen) Drive or E-mail with a hard copy of the same in the instance where the Society does not have its own web site or any other web site belonging to the Society for the purpose of uploading to the website of the Department of Co-operative Development, North-Western, subject to the Electoral Regulation 55.4.\n\n2.2 section 5.2 (c) of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended by the addition therefor of the following paragraph.\n\n(c) Publishing advertisement in a Sinhala National Daily Newspaper and a Tamil National Daily Newspaper in Sinhala and Tamil medium respectively.\n\nAmendment of section 14.2 of the Code of Regulations"
