    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'12PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.07.2019\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2131$57 - 2019 cQ,s 12 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'07'12No. 2131/57 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 12, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef. No. of the Divisional Secretary: KDS/KGK/4/9/94/143.Ref. No. of the Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms:13/96/VE/130.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section of Section 7 of the LandAcquisition Act, that the Government intend to acquire the landdescribed below which is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nThe Allotments of lands Lot Nos. 01 to 05 in total extent 0.6150Hectares depited in the Preliminary Plan No. KY 6812 dated27.12.2018 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveyor ofKandy District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in theVillage of Hindagala in the Grama Niladhari Division of (267)Hindagala in the Minor Division of the Divisional Secretariat Divisionof Kandy Kadawathsathara and Gangawata Korale in the District ofKandy, Central Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Mowbrey Estate; Claimant: State; Original claimant:V. Jonathan, Near Mowbrey Bungalow, Mahakanda, Hindagala;Extent: 0.1170 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02Name of land: Mowbrey Estate; Claimant: State; Original claimant:Mohomed Lathief, No. 09, Aranayake Mawatha, Mawanella; Extent:0.3270 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 03Name of land: Mowbrey Estate; Claimant: State; Original claimant:V. Jonathan, Near Mowbrey Bungalow, Mahakanda, Hindagala;Extent: 0.1200 Hectare.\n\n04. Lot No. 04Name of land: \u2013; Claimant: