    "chunk_text": "The above organization has been registered as a Voluntary Agricultural Organization under the Department of AgricultureSouthern Province on.................................................................(date) under Number......................................................\n\nDate :\n\n7AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.2019\n\nREGISTRATION OF ORGANIC FERTILIZER MANUFACTURERS UNDER THE SOUTHERNPROVINCE AGRICULTURE DEPARTMENT\n\nConditions :\n\n1. Should be a permanent resident of the Southern Province.\n\n2. The organic manufacturing plant should be located within the Southern Province.\n\n3. The organic fertilzer manufacturing process should be subject to the supervision of the Provincial Director ofAgriculture or an officer of the Southern Province Department of Agriculture empowered by the ProvincialDirector of Agriculture, in periodic intervals.\n\n4. The manufacturer should provide samples of the organic fertilizer produced to the relevant authorized officerappointed to inspect the quality of the fertilizer whenever such requirement to inspect arises.\n\n5. The manufacturer should ensure that the quality standards mandatory for the fertilizer produced should bemaintained at all times.\n\n6. In the event where different organic fertilizer manufacturers have been subject to a categorization by the SouthernProvince Department of Agriculutre, the manufacturer should submit to such categorization.\n\n7. If the organic fertilizer manufactured is being sold in the market, the fertilizer should be in a regularised contianer(bag) approved by the Southern Province Agricultural Department.\n\n8. An organic fertilizer manufacturer who manufacturers fertilizer as above will be entitled to sell his fertilizer atthe Ruhunu Rasara Trade Organization after having obtained the necessary registration.\n\nRegistration :"
