    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'22PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.07.20191A\n\nL. D. B. 8/1980 (ii)\n\nMAHAWELI AUTHORITY OF SRI LANKA ACT, NO. 23 OF 1979\n\nOrder under Section 3\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 3 of the Mahaweli Authority of Sri Lanka Act, No. 23 of 1979, read withSection 51 of the Nineteenth Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka I, MaithripalaSirisena, the President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka do hereby declare the areas set out in the Schedulehereto as \u201cSpecial Area\u201d for the purposes of the Act.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA,President.\n\nColombo,15th July, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nArea depicted by the following boundaries of the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Minipe in the Administrative District ofKandy and the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Vilgamuwa in the Administrative District of Matale.\n\nTo North:\n\nFrom the place where Dunuwila Lake dam and Dunuwila Oya joins to the place where Jeep or cart track meet the ThoppalapitiyaGovernment Forest along the Dunuwila Oya and thence to the place where the center meets Muthuwangana Oya along theJeep or cart track and thence to the center point of the Mahaweli River through the Muthuwangana Oya.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nwxl 2133$2 \u2013 2019 cQ,s ui 22 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'07'22No. 2133/2 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 22, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G30540 \u2013 67 (07/2019)\n\n2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrc