    "chunk_text": "4.At the commencement of a search, an authorized specified officer shall show the person in charge of a place ofdetention the authorization and where such person in charge of such place of detention makes a request, give acopy of such authorization.\n\nPart III\n\n5.An authorized specified officer may-\n\n(a)search any part of the premises of a place of detention;\n\n(b)question any person in such place of detention to ascertain the conditions of detention or inrelation to any matter relating to the mandate of the OMP;\n\n(c)retain any document or object found in such place of detention;\n\n(d)make copies of any document referred to in paragraph (c);\n\n(e)take photographs of such place of detention or any object, document, vehicle or any other matterincluding any sign or physical evidence found in such place of detention; or\n\n(f)search any vehicle in a place of detention.\n\nPart IV\n\nProcedural Requirements\n\n6.The OMP shall maintain a logbook of all searches of places of detention conducted by the authorised specifiedofficers.\n\nI fldgi : f\u00feoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'24PART I : SECTION I - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.07.2019\n\n3A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n7.An authorized specified officer of the OMP conducting a search of a place of detention shall make a written recordof such search in the logbook immediately after the conclusion of such search. Where such record has not beenmade immediately after the conclusion of the search due to unavoidable circumstances, such record shall be madeas soon as reasonably practicable.\n\n8.A written record made in the logbook under Guideline 7 shall include-\n\n(a)details of the authorization of the search;\n\n(b)address of the place of detention in which the search was conducted;\n\n(c)date, time and duration of the search;\n\n(d)names and any descriptive information of persons present at the place of detention at thetime of the search;"
