    "chunk_text": "At the Divisional Secretariat, Bentota. 22nd of July, 2019. 08 - 353\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30591 - 25 (2019/07)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nAS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice Under Section 07\n\nLand Ministry's No. : 4-3/8/2017/PC/515.\n\nMy Reference No.: BER 4/5/2/58. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe lot No. 01 in Surveyor General\u2019s Plan No. \u0d9a 4757 is situated at village of Aluthgama in Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division of 765-Aluthgama East in Divisional Secretariat Division of Beruwala in Kaluthara District, Western Province.\n\nLot No. 01 Name of the land: Dehigahawatta; Description: Acquisition for K/Sanghamiththa Balika Vidyalaya; Claimant: Sembakutti Kankanamge Samson Fernando; Extent: 0.0885 Hectare.\n\nDescription of the Land Marks : North : Road and Dehigahawatta claimed by B. Indunil Fernando and Road; East : Dehigahawatta claimed\n\nby B. Indunil Fernando, Road and Walipanna Road; South : Walipanna Road and Sellagewatta claimed by Sangamiththa Balika Vidyalaya; West : Sellagewaththa Possess by Sangamiththa Balika Vidyalaya and Lindamulagewatta (Lot No. 1 of Plan No. P.P.K. 2386)."
